# Optional hard-block list for the pre-commit PII guard (scripts/check_pii.py).
#
# Copy to ``.pii-deny`` (git-ignored) and add one Python regex per line for
# exact literals you never want committed — a real surname, a specific NI
# number, a real IBAN, a real balance. Keeping them here (not in the
# committed guard) means the secrets themselves never enter the repo.
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. Examples (replace with
# your own real values in the git-ignored copy):
#
#   (?i)\bsmith\b
#   \bGB00[A-Z0-9]{8}\b
#   \b57909\.10\b
